Six-hour trip to London. That's a lot of Monica.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,310
Passport, check. Camera, check. Traveler's checks, check.

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,810
Who are you saying "check" to?

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,810
Myself.

8
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,600
For remembering to pack the thing.

9
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:28,650
You know, you do a good thing, you get a check.

10
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:33,820
My mom does it. I never realized it was weird.

11
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:37,280
Hey, my mom used to put her head in the oven, so...

12
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:40,780
Actually, she only did it the one time. But it was pretty weird.

13
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,660
Hey.

14
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,660
Hey.

15
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,250
Hey. Are you ready yet?

16
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:49,750
Yep. You got the tickets?

17
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:49,750
Oh, got them right here. Check.

18
