Heh. Yeah, okay. Give that a try.

27
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:11,880
All right, let's do it.

28
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:11,880
Woohoo.

29
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,210
Yeah. Cheerio.

30
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,210
London, baby.

31
