37
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:33,730
Oh, I'll come hug you.

38
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:33,730
Great, can you bring me the newspaper?

39
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,440
Yeah.

40
00:02:35,610 --> 00:02:37,780
Have a great wedding. Oh.

41
00:02:35,610 --> 00:02:37,780
Thanks.

42
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:40,110
Hey, Chandler, I wanna hug you too.

43
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:40,110
Hey.

44
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:44,410
And you might as well bring me my book. It's on the counter in your apartment.

45
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,210
So we're off.

46
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,210
Have fun.

47
00:02:51,370 --> 00:02:52,880
Thanks.

48
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:55,710
Oh. I can't believe you're not gonna be there.

49
