All right, you know what? Now we are late. Let's go, let's go, let's go!

58
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:21,490
Fine, you'll watch it on video when we get back.

59
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:25,700
Here you go, Phoebe. Here you go, Phoebo, Phoobala, Phobayboo.

60
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,500
You. Ha, ha.

61
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,460
All right, let's go. Bye, Pheebs.

62
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,340
Bye.

63
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,340
Bye, Pheebs.

64
00:03:37,630 --> 00:03:39,000
Mwah. Goodbye. Mwah.

65
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,630
Bye.

66
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,630
Safe flight.

67
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,550
London, baby.

68
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:47,890
Oh, God.

69
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:47,890
Oh. Do you need a hug?

70
