All right, Chandler, do something.

72
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:15,210
Come on, do something.

73
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:15,210
I am. I'm ignoring you.

74
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:17,750
Okay, I'm gonna be the on-camera guy. All right.

75
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:22,760
First stop, Westminster Abbey.

76
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:26,800
Oh, what the hell is that?

77
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:26,800
That's London, baby.

78
00:04:26,970 --> 00:04:28,850
All right, the hotel's here.

79
00:04:29,010 --> 00:04:31,600
Wait. No, we wanna go...

80
00:04:33,890 --> 00:04:35,520
No.

81
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:37,230
I know.

82
00:04:37,730 --> 00:04:39,860
I'm gonna have to go into the map.

83
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:48,660
Okay, if you see a little version of me in there, kill it.

84
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,370
I got it.

85
