Here we go.

86
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:58,000
Okay, listen, listen, we're not gonna have to walk this way the entire time, are we?

87
00:04:58,170 --> 00:04:59,460
Shh.

88
00:05:00,210 --> 00:05:02,170
Oh, man, you made me lose it.

89
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,930
And that was all before 10:00.

90
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:13,390
The caterer rang to say it's gonna be chicken kiev instead of tarragon.

91
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,850
The florist phoned to say there aren't any tulips.

92
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:18,520
Oh, and then the cellist has carpal tunnel syndrome...

93
00:05:18,690 --> 00:05:20,730
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Emily, honey. Okay?

94
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:23,110
Well, up yours too.

95
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:23,110
What?

96
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,780
No, no. That's "time-out."

97
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,780
Sorry.

98
00:05:26,950 --> 00:05:30,820
Sweetie, you gotta relax. Everything's gonna be great, okay?

99
00:05:30,990 --> 00:05:32,780
Come on, come on.

100
